Vendored data and token programs
--------------------------------

* KaspaCom KCC20 0.2.5 token program artifact -- contracts/third-party/kaspacom-kcc20/
  Copyright KaspaCom. Apache License 2.0 (contracts/third-party/kaspacom-kcc20/LICENSE).
  Vendored unmodified except for line endings (UPSTREAM.md there).

* Reference KCC-20 token program (argent-lang/kcc20-reference, pull request #1) --
  contracts/kcc20/, contracts/argent/kcc20_8x8.ag, tools/wallet-gate/contracts/ and derived
